Z||000000||Master_Sushi||09-08-2000||04:39 PM||||Tell me what you think about this... I jsut got my new "Automobile Magizine" in the mail today, I was very suprised to see a nice pic of a fiero on page 58 while reading it. But then when I read what they had to say about it made me VERY angrey. The reviewer basicly said it didnt even handel as well as GM station wagons and sedans, and its "performance was barley adequate". Obviously the person who wrote this never drove a fiero, let alone knows anything about them <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">. Ill post a link to the article. (I dont want to upload copyrighted material to cliffs server)<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/master_sushi2000/fiero.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/master_sushi2000/fiero.jpg</A>    They are sure to get a nice flame of a letter written to them by me...||||reg||8
